{title: Laare}
{artist: Maninder Buttar B Praak}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
Main [D]sab kujh chhad ditta [G]tere karke
[Am]Tere utton sab kujh [D]vaari baithi aan,        Tainu [D]pata taa hai par [G]fikar nahi
[Am]Tere layi mai yara ve [D]kawari baithi aan,        [D]Yaari tere ve [Bm]yaari
Jismaan [G]tak hai saari di saari [D]yaari,        [D]Ve dhakka [Am]hona mere naal [D]
Mainu [D]pata bas laare [G]aa,        Ve tu [Am]viah ni karauna mere [D]naal
[D]Akhiyan?ch surma main [G]pauna chhaddta,        [Am]Jagde hi rahiye haye [G]sona chhadta
[D]Akhiyan?ch surma main [G]pauna chhaddta,        [D]Jagde hi rahiye haye [G]sona chhadta
[D]Tere pichhe chhadte main [G]ghar de mere,        [D]Tere pichhe hasna ha [G]sauna chhadta
Kyun [Am]raule pauna mere naal [D],        Mainu [D]pata bas laare [G]aa
Ve tu [Am]viah ni karauna mere [D]naal,        Mainu [D]pata bas laare [G]aa
